# MetaOS base package manifest — the format frozen in
# metaos-contracts/PACKAGES.md: one apt package per line, `#fetch <url> <dest>`
# for files. A lane appends its own lines and never edits another lane's.
#
# Binaries the Xubuntu 24.04.5 base image already provides. Listed so the
# desktop entries can be checked against something real: a launcher for a
# program nobody installs is a dead icon.
#base: thunar xfce4-terminal xfce4-settings-manager chromium

# Lane: theme and shell
plank
fonts-inter
lightdm-gtk-greeter

# Lane: boot and install
plymouth
calamares
